mes和OMP, SSH 22, port 2222, public-key-only, keyboard-interactive, Hermes v0.20.0, OMP 17.2.12, known_hosts, recovery cleanup, Windows build 26200, hermes-omp-provider-sync\n\n## Task 3: Audit the complete competitive-intelligence workflow and prepare rearchitecture design, outcome: only read-only inventory/baseline was completed; later Phase 5.2 work occurred in a different `competitive-intelligence-workflow` checkout and must not be credited to this audit\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-09T08-58-28-UfXz-competitive_intelligence_a_report_audit_safety_matrix_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/竞品调研工作流, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/08/09/rollout-2026-08-09T16-58-28-019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-27T22:09:14+00:00, thread_id=019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9, read-only audit baseline; later A-report repair is in a different checkout)\n\n### keywords\n\n- competitive-intelligence, `竞品调研工作流_PRD.md`, `竞品调研工作流_完整设计文档.md`, `ci_workflow_rearchitecture_20260809`, PRD, ORCHESTRATOR, L1, L2, L3, PICOS-M-A-Opr, BLOCKED_SOURCE, A/B/C reports, `trial_uid → drug_name`, implementation freeze, cross-project drift\n\n## Task 4: Repair A-report value coverage and responsive safety matrix, outcome: partial; production changes were checkpointed without `final-v5`, final visual review, or release replacement\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-09T08-58-28-UfXz-competitive_intelligence_a_report_audit_safety_matrix_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/competitive-intelligence-workflow, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/08/09/rollout-2026-08-09T16-58-28-019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-27T22:09:14+00:00, thread_id=019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9, no-loss pause after data/layout repair)\n\n### keywords\n\n- A-report, atopic-dermatitis, safety-heatmap, 3+1, `safetyTermsPerBlock()`, `report-a.js`, `portal.css`, `test_a_portal.py:615`, final-v5, Chromium, WebKit, no-loss-pause\n\n## Task 5: Deploy the Windows Home Agent and create secure cross-device client handoff, outcome: success; browser remote control, private SSH/SFTP transport, native Hermes/OMP launch, and a verified client task book were established\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-09T05-55-17-m9as-windows_hermes_omp_home_agent_remote_client_handoff.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/08/09/rollout-2026-08-09T13-55-17-019fe516-ff60-7ac1-a8b3-06b9dd6142ac.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-02T01:22:45+00:00, thread_id=019fe516-ff60-7ac1-a8b3-06b9dd6142ac, recovery-derived deployment/client-handoff evidence; revalidate live state)\n\n### keywords\n\n- MeshCentral, Tailscale, SSH_OVER_TAILSCALE_OK, home-agent, Windows, Hermes v0.20.0, OMP 17.2.12, WSL2, HomeAgentWorkspace, ED25519, host-key-pinning, HOME_AGENT_CLIENT_READY, windows-remote-bootstrap\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when registry information already covers the needed clinical design facts, the user corrected a strict Protocol/SAP rule: use claim-driven supplementary acquisition; annotate missing unpublished statistical details instead of routinely blocking the C report. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- for competitive-research output, the user chose independent multi-select HTML portal, HTML-PPT, editable PPTX, and PDF generation/QC; editable PPTX must follow Kangzhe design spec through PPT-master. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- when the user asks to “全量遍历整个工程”, cover PRD, design, handoff, Skills, tests, data, and real reports before proposing a rebuild; keep the implementation frozen through design discussion/approval. [Task 3]\n- when the user requested “无损暂停” during the A-report repair -> stop implementation/testing, preserve files/evidence and a checkpoint, retain the old formal entry, and do not overwrite or clean user artifacts. [Task 4]\n- when visual review found 3+1 heatmap layout and Chinese character-by-character wrapping, the user rejected “no horizontal scroll” as the sole success criterion -> check overflow, four-dimension co-display, Chinese readability, information hierarchy, and filter consistency separately. [Task 4]\n- when access must work from “手机和其他的Windows、Mac电脑”, compare native Windows and WSL2 explicitly rather than assuming WSL2 is mandatory. For a client handoff another Agent can “直接搞好”, provide a self-contained task book that pauses only for user authentication and public-key enrollment. [Task 5]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n- Preserve a project-local SQLite domain database for entities/facts/relationships/indexes/audit state, append-only events, immutable snapshots/diffs/report versions, and explicit missing states such as `not_reported`, `searched_no_evidence`, `access_blocked`, `technical_failed`, `awaiting_user`, `not_applicable`, and `conflicting`. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- Registry-first C-report threshold: complete official registry coverage of population, arms/intervention, endpoints, timepoints, and practical design facts can pass with explicit registry-only annotation; do not chase a Protocol/SAP unless it is the remaining claim blocker. A later document creates a new version rather than overwriting earlier evidence. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- The observed Windows checkpoint had SSH 22 running/autostarted, Hermes `v0.20.0 / 2026.8.3`, and OMP `17.2.12`; temporary port 2222 was a recovery path. Treat this as a checkpoint and revalidate keys/listeners/cleanup before claiming hardened remote access. [Task 2] [chronicle memory]\n- The audited architecture is ORCHESTRATOR + L1 multi-source collection + L2 extraction/adjudication + L3 analysis/rendering/QC/export. Its facts rule is: no snapshot, no fact-store entry; unknowns use `null` plus a controlled missing state; restricted sources become `BLOCKED_SOURCE`/evidence debt; insufficient evidence cannot rank; cross-trial comparison must retain non-head-to-head/comparability limits. [Task 3]\n- The read-only audit found A=适应症竞品 Profile, B=竞品临床试验结果, and C=竞品临床试验方案设计 as independent report contracts sharing collection, fact-store, and QC layers. Existing W0-W9 and 12-Skill design are a baseline, not proof that B/C passed independent validation or that a redesign is approved. [Task 3]\n- `clinical-competitive-intelligence` notes that CT.gov result data can lack `drug_name`: derive `trial_uid → drug_name` from `trials`/`trial_arms` before aggregation. Keep raw Hb units plus g/L, assemble large HTML in chunks, and preflight undefined JS functions, empty chart/table containers, drug-name spelling, and browser console. [Task 3]\n- For the A-report safety matrix, use 2+2 below 900 px and four dimensions in one matrix at >=900 px; do not let a layout threshold exceed the actual host width. Narrow screens should hide secondary columns or use an explicit responsive fallback rather than split medical Chinese such as `未公开` character by character. [Task 4]\n- Chart and detail table must consume the same filter result; default safety dimension/group requires a visible accessible selected state. The checkpoint records 38 products, efficacy values for 28, any safety value for 26, and exact treatment-arm any-TEAE for 20 after adding 10 paired overall TEAE values and clearing 14 stale empty placeholders. [Task 4]\n- The observed Phase 0 baseline reported `a2d1f88`, Ruff, mypy, six passing tests, old-dependency scan, `uv lock --check`, and freeze sync; it also retained two Kangzhe design sources unmodified while Task 0.4 had not started. Treat those as a checkpoint, not release proof. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- MeshCentral provides browser/mobile Desktop, Terminal, and Files access without client Tailscale. Tailscale is the private SSH/SFTP/SCP transport: this rollout verified `tailscale ping home-agent`, `ssh home-agent`, and `SSH_OVER_TAILSCALE_OK`. On iPhone, use Anywhere plus MeshCentral Safari because iOS has a single active VPN slot; keep Tailscale off. With Clash/TUN, route `100.64.0.0/10`, `fd7a:115c:a1e0::/48`, and `*.ts.net` DIRECT; do not expose TCP 22 or use an Exit Node. [Task 5]\n- MeshCentral Terminal is SYSTEM; invoke `omp`, `hermes`, and `homeuser` through the protected ordinary-user loopback SSH bridge. Verified TUIs used `HomeAgentWorkspace`; Hermes was `v0.20.0` and OMP `17.2.12`. Native Hermes supports most CLI/TUI/gateway/cron/browser/MCP/dashboard work, but the dashboard embedded POSIX `/chat` terminal remains WSL2-only; OMP is native Windows. [Task 5]\n- The reusable client artifact is `windows-remote-bootstrap/交给另一台电脑Agent执行-Home Agent客户端配置.md`: generate an independent ED25519 key per client, pin the Windows host key, preserve existing SSH/Clash config, verify SSH plus SHA-256 file round trip, and report `HOME_AGENT_CLIENT_READY`. Never copy a private key or embed credentials, TOTP, cookies, or provider secrets. [Task 5]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Symptom: missing Protocol/SAP causes automatic blocking. Cause: document completeness is conflated with field sufficiency. Fix: test the specific report claim against registry field sufficiency; mark the boundary and acquire supplementary documents only when necessary. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- Symptom: temporary SSH recovery is treated as complete hardening. Cause: current-port safety, successful/failed key authentication, reboot behavior, and port-2222 cleanup are not all evidenced. Fix: keep the remaining verification sequence explicit and do not mutate the primary SSH path prematurely. [Task 2] [chronicle memory]\n- Symptom: a finished-status document is treated as a validated rearchitecture or approved report redesign. Cause: document claims, code/data/artifact evidence, and user design approval were conflated. Fix: complete the evidence audit, question rounds, target design, and phased plan before writing implementation; preserve the current freeze. [Task 3]\n- Symptom: an implementation/test run is reported as progress on the audit. Cause: the rollout drifted into `/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/competitive-intelligence-workflow`, a different checkout/task. Fix: continuously check cwd and task ID; stop at a cross-project boundary and return first with the audit evidence and decision questions. [Task 3]\n- Symptom: root-document bulk reading loses audit evidence. Cause: terminal output truncation. Fix: read by file/section and retain an audit index; do not delete large neighboring untracked artifacts during the audit. [Task 3]\n- Symptom: post-fix targeted tests show 64 passed/4 failed. Cause: `tests/browser/test_a_portal.py:615` still asserts the old 1024/1280 layout contract. Fix: update the assertion for four-dimension co-display, then rerun tests and real Chromium/WebKit renders at 768/1024/1280/1440 before building immutable `final-v5` or replacing the formal artifact. [Task 4]\n- Symptom: heatmap and detail table disagree after a “common adverse events” filter, or the default treatment-group button is not pressed. Fix: explicitly test filter slicing and accessible selected state; neither data presence nor no-overflow is release acceptance. [Task 4]\n- Symptom: a projection-layer discussion is called a finished portable design package. Cause: the recording only showed convergence on whether `design_specs/` should be generated from track files or preserve dual-file CI. Fix: preserve the unresolved packaging decision and validate the selected source-of-truth/CI path before declaring portability. [Task 1] [chronicle memory]\n- Symptom: a SYSTEM management terminal is used to run the user’s agents, or a version/TUI startup is called full model capability. Cause: control and execution contexts were conflated, and no model prompt was sent in this path-repair run. Fix: use the ordinary-user bridge and separately prove a real model invocation when that capability matters. [Task 5]\n- Symptom: a device is merely online in `tailscale status`, or fully unattended enrollment is promised. Cause: presence was confused with transport validation and user-controlled auth/authorization was skipped. Fix: require `tailscale ping` plus real SSH, and stop only for the user’s Tailscale/MeshCentral login and new public-key enrollment. [Task 5]\n\n# Task Group: clinical-trial full-process manual and interactive HTML panorama\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"## 结论：rejected\n\n## 六项修复复查（逐项 1-2 句）\n\n1. **非产品干预过滤：部分生效，未闭合。** 已看不到 placebo、imaging、采血、问卷、CliniMACS 等实体，但仍有 `myeloablative preparative regimen`、`systemic chemotherapy...`、`campath...allo SCT`、`c5 inhibitor`、`carbon-14 labeled HSK39297` 等非竞品实体。\n\n2. **别名映射：未完全生效。** `pnh-alias-map-v1.json` 中声明的配对本身未见明显错误归并，但载荷仍同时存在 `iptacopan`/`iptacopan (lnp023)`、`cemdisiran`/`aln-cc5`、`eculizumab`/`eculizumab injection`，说明复合名称、制剂名和连字符别名未统一。\n\n3. **状态优先级：对规范实体已生效，但整体仍不一致。** `eculizumab` 已为“已批准上市”，但其拆分实体仍为“招募中”，`iptacopan (lnp023)`仍为“已完成”，因此不能视为产品层面完全修复。\n\n4. **区域派生：生效。** 载荷中已有中国试验和产品区域；55 条试验标为中国，且 `NCT04820530` 为中国/境外并存，区域不再全部固定为境外。\n\n5. **试验-产品多对多：未在载荷中实现。** `trials.product_id` 仍是单值字段；例如 `NCT06799546` 的 HSK39297+eculizumab 仅归到 `eculizumab-injection`，`NCT04558918` 的 LNP023+eculizumab+ravulizumab 仅归到 `eculizumab`。未在载荷或审计包中看到可执行的 G11-1 限制记录。\n\n6. **未披露样本量排除清单：未充分记档。** history 仅写“4 条”，没有 NCT 明细；源派生材料可见至少 5 条无样本量且有药物干预的记录，数量与排除项均不可审计。\n\n## 新问题（若有）\n\n- 别名表键与派生规范化不一致：代码先移除连字符，`ALN-CC5` 变为 `alncc5`，但映射表键为 `aln-cc5`，导致 cemdisiran 未合并。\n- 复合干预采用排序后取第一项，造成疗效、安全性、申办方关系可能错误归属。\n- 过滤依赖名称黑名单，未建立干预角色/背景治疗/对照的结构化分类。\n- 61 个产品只是结构数量，不能作为已闭合的竞品数量；需补齐排除审计、规范化身份、试验-产品边和样本量排除明细后重新派生、校验和独立复核。\n- 中国路线 `access_blocked`、CT.gov 当前快照及历史宇宙限制可作为透明边界保留，但不能抵消当前载荷的语义错误。\n\n## 观察意见（原样进入 scientific_review.observations，中文，≤5 条）\n\n1. 当前产品清单仍包含移植预处理、系统化疗、通用补体抑制剂及同位素标记研究等非竞品或非独立资产实体。  \n2. 主要资产的别名、复合名称和制剂名称尚未完成统一，导致同一资产被拆分并产生状态冲突。  \n3. 试验载荷仍为单一 `product_id`，联合治疗和活性对照无法完整表达，产品级疗效与安全性归属存在偏差风险。  \n4. 中国区域派生已出现真实结果，但区域正确不等于资产身份和试验关系已闭合。  \n5. 在中国路线访问受限、历史宇宙不纳入当前快照的边界下，当前载荷仍不具备首验 accepted 条件。\n\n"}}
